// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3472459460" "Mmm...  Such lovely parts."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3301682328" "He will be pleased."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2478198145" "These must be retrieved."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3713924036" "Ahh...my pretty."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2935471318" "This will do nicely."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3764137425" "Brains!"
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4006997119" "Good to the bone."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1136508332" "An excellent specimen."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3541809080" "Leg bone connected to the hip bone..."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4183358732" "Mine...all mine."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2583332611" "I will make this quick."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2444767916" "This will hurt you more than it will hurt me."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2910955947" "Eeny, meeny, miney..."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1852413377" "A match made in hell."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P558139714" "Ooh, very fresh."

// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2760511573" "Come to join the Harvest?"
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3928750550" "Your donation will be appreciated."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2195291629" "You should not interfere."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3624568551" "Ah, excellent...upgrades."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P305349288" "I hope you will provide premium parts."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P779758904" "Hungry?"
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P992023545" "This is not for your eyes."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P691615541" "More brains."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2952482253" "You are not welcome here."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1811047838" "Leave this place."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3391896036" "Wait your turn."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2725890603" "You are next, hero."
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P524586797" "Did you bring me a present?"
// HARVEST_HARVESTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P98971496" "More powers for the pool."

// HARVEST_MINION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1107728208" "Must...serve..."
// HARVEST_MINION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3415076468" "Urgh."

// BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1058935711" "Must seek for the master."
// BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1783684902" "I know there are parts inside."

// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P352844878" "Why should I care what you feel?"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2127437818" "I'm taking your body for research. It's not personal."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3774826918" "Think of it as an early organ donation."

// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1618399472" "Fresh parts are always best."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2008747448" "I've never used hero parts before."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2784832431" "Your insurance isn't going to cover this."

// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3748957353" "Please don't do this!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1624559910" "I'm a person, not body parts!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2193623524" "I'll give you money! My watch! Anything!"

// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1859420539" "Thank you for saving me from those madmen."
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3046254228" "You're so brave to fight them."
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P2494714516" "They were going to tear me apart!"

// AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3753742563" "Your body parts will serve the Vahzilok!"
// AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2525584202" "Leave as much intact as possible."
// AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3736658762" "Take them alive if you can."

// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4115021074" "Who are you to judge our genius!"
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1814929772" "They call us mad? Us! MAD?"
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1348194528" "Your physique looks...useful..."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3456492384" "Atlas Park is now MY playground..."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3054664337" "Welcome to your nightmare."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P163303293" "I have you now, hero."

// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3715597086" "I see opportunity in Atlas Park.  So much...opportunity."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2580257147" "They'll be perfect for us.  So full of life.  So full of nutrients."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2782885693" "It's like a walking talking supermarket..."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P142832789" "We should have come to Atlas Park sooner.  So very much sooner."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P330388083" "A plethora of body parts.  My goodness.  So much to choose from."

// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2584747699" "I smell opportunity."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4102339200" "Oh, come here little hero.  I have a surprise for you."
// ATLAS_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P969742724" "Death comes unexpectedly!"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1076577150" "Surprise...  And now for my next trick..."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3287038993" "And...now to your doom."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2352147471" "Hello.  And goodbye."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_RESURRECTAMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2582293680" "Don't think of it as pain, think of it as torture for the greater good.  My greater good."

// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1700867374" "This city is like a supermarket of opportunity."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2761394494" "So many choices...where shall we start?"
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1595476471" "I love Galaxy City.  Such fresh meat."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4100466043" "The freshest meat is right by that Brawler fellow."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1535030109" "If you want real choice limbs, do go check out that Brawler fellow.  The youngest ones tend to flock to him."

// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1882743073" "Here comes the meat aisle now..."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2861138264" "Ah!  Dinner and a movie, maybe?"
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P632031927" "Oh look!  The entertainment has arrived."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P797367396" "And the prey comes to the hunter.  How delightful."
// GALAXY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3032323743" "It's like the supermarket came to us."

// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1473550405" "The surprise is just beginning..."
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1603255707" "Now what kind of welcome is that?  I thought Atlas Park was such a friendly city!"
// ATLAS_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2941162217" "Fancy meeting you here.  Care to join me for dinner?"

// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4275792057" "Surprise!"
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1229237159" "I can do a lot with you."
// GALAXY_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3420934056" "The fun is just starting, my friend.  Well, for me."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3755348696" "The fun has just begun!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1642657598" "And now...we prepare."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4121912193" "Nothing like a little prep work to get the skills warmed up.  You will be my canvas."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P916024325" "This is a good spot.  We'll come back later for them.  They're not getting any more alive."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3713850277" "Perfect.  Great location.  We can store a few here."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2108626687" "This should be about right.  Perfect for temporary storage."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2528175838" "Interruption!  Take care of it!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P769758923" "You shouldn't have gotten nosey.  You'll pay dearly for it."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3758552867" "Looks like we'll need some more digging locations!"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1250958843" "Oh dear.  Your day just got very...very bad."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1757711648" "Striking at night is the easiest.  They're so unaware."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421264946" "Well, it's really simple, you see.  I look at it as art."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1853950079" "Truly, this is about the beauty of the flesh, is it not?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4247402529" "We can do much with a hacksaw and some elbow grease."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1559022889" "The beauty is in the details, really.  Don't you think?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1516499636" "We'll move the bodies this evening.  I have a perfect spot in mind."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1153560313" "Kings Row is a veritable gold mine of prey."

// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4058537800" "And who might you be?"
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1515951586" "I may be able to use this one..."
// KINGSROW_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2156774430" "I see prospects.  I can use this.  Come here, donor."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3059715192" "Did I frighten you?  Oh good.  Scared victims are so much more fun to work with."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3502855239" "Oh hello!  Welcome to your nightmare!  It's just beginning."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2851073534" "You'll do!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_EMERGE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2115278015" "My my!  Look what we have here.  Prospects."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P236865418" "Here is fine.  We'll come back later for them."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P920475496" "If you don't hurry, the sun will come up soon and spoil the meat.  Move it along now."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P399957131" "No one will miss this one."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P280394930" "A little deeper, we wouldn't want some heroes stumbling across our storage 'facility' now would we?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3742845996" "Well, hello.  Will you be needing those limbs?  I thought not."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1680501070" "Aren't you the perfect little specimen?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3718813416" "I can do much with you.  Tell me, do you moisturize?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2872800620" "This will only hurt for a....well, for several hours, really."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2366278875" "Such a pretty little lamb."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P961605743" "You'll do."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4194220644" "I can do much with that one."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4246600005" "I should make sure to pick that one up later."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P532302054" "Ahem."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1333626397" "Ah.  I'm afraid your evening just fell to pieces."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4174903149" "You'll do just fine."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2781825772" "Good evening.  For me, at least."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P445896159" "Ah, a hero.  Plucky one, aren't you?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3818117537" "I like a good scrimmage before supper."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4199647268" "Even with the minor setback of the flood, this place is...ripe with opportunity."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1451215733" "Well, in the end it all worked out for our gain, did it not?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4162488709" "Maybe we can even snag a few heroes while we're at it.  They try so hard to defeat us, but we just keep coming."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2330072440" "It's touching.  Renovating the city.  The parks.  The construction.  It's perfect, really."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P119985505" "I like this place much better now.  There are so many more prospects."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1605346625" "Where did you hide it?  Which construction site?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1268112675" "Ah, more meat for the grinder."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1935240877" "Come here, hero!  You look quite fit!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2256058337" "I'm going to grind your bones into dust, hero."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3177136052" "Ah, look at that.  Sleeping so peacefully.  Just like death."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1012874179" "Shhh...  I see great prospects in here.  This one is ripe for the picking."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3316543522" "Oh how precious.  Let's take this one."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3068817834" "I don't like to share!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4139914654" "You are NOT getting in on this action!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P206711777" "Why must you interfere?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3220644959" "Well?  How we doing?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362506167" "See anything useful?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3762884569" "Well?  What do you see?"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P534836926" "We've got company!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P194888267" "The good guys are here."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_PEERIN_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2564091448" "I think we're going to have to come back later."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P534348889" "I'm not going in there."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P929018720" "Vahzilok do not swim."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3223680601" "Forget it.   I'm not going in."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_NOSWIM_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3542052452" "Let's see how you do, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2894239490" "Wh-what did I do?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4209118852" "I'm just a construction worker!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P116829673" "What is all this??"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2076470775" "Shush.  I'd hate to have to use this.  I'll already have to cut your feet off at the shin."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4100262213" "What a waste.  I suppose acid will destoy the feet as well?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3682645686" "Well this is a predicament."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4066610567" "Don't move.  You're very close to the deep end."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P610144739" "I hate heroes!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1322681277" "Interference!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1274570656" "We were almost done!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3532189126" "I'm not seeing it here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2182134136" "We've been digging for hours.  I don't think the bodies are here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3014108533" "My arms are getting tired.  If they were here, we'd see them by now."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3567102608" "Nothing here."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4212445314" "Whoops!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2624248610" "This one will do!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_EXHUMEBODY_SEARCHING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P258857919" "Fresh meat!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1693227631" "What's taking so long?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4072691013" "Taking too long here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1549429559" "How hard is it to find one body?  We just buried it last week!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2949493903" "Hurry up."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1003182480" "You didn't see anything!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_HIDEBODIES_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P602894667" "Great.  Another hero!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P830440594" "We can bury the bodies in the woods.  No problem."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1443169991" "Well, we have our work cut out for us.  Not as many wandering pedestrians here.  At least we have heroes we can use."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3936805388" "Well, what do you think?  Possibilities?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821430800" "Well sure, we have some competition from Circle of Thorns, but not really.  They just want the souls, we can recycle the bodies.  It's all about equity management."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P6103571" "I guess we need to get started."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2044742714" "Hero is here to spoil the day, as usual."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ARMSCROSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2548781296" "Oh great.  It's you."

// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4136081682" "How would you two like to share one body?"
// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3865968211" "Nice head. I think I'll take it."
// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2296850455" "A pretty face, yes. But it's what's on the INSIDE that counts here!"
// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3237771435" "You have pretty eyes. Give them to me."

// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2787765870" "Wha? A HERO!?"
// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1320857896" "Gah! You'll pay for that, cape!"
// KINGS_HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1512188260" "What's this? She was in the bag until YOU scared her away!"

// KINGS_VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3230101424" "Please don't hurt me! I'll do anything."
// KINGS_VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3892392184" "What do you want with me?"
// KINGS_VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1028584895" "Why are you doing this?"
// KINGS_VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2860248756" "Who are you people?"
// KINGS_VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P568762117" "Please! let me go."

// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_LIEU_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2561467491" "You're going to use THAT knife?"
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_LIEU_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2568104109" "I hope that's a practice lot you're working on."
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_LIEU_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2472513073" "Did you take my lot 29? She appears to be... missing."

// KINGS_WORKSHOP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2474731215" "I think I can fit you into my schedule."
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2067890200" "You didn't make an appointment, did you?"
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1761284539" "It's SO much easier when we don't have to recruit."
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3269958651" "And what can the good doctor do for you this fine hour?"
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3986894277" "No insurance? No problem. We'll take a donation instead!"

// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_BOSS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3417313275" "Hey, who's the barber here?"
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_BOSS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2491072642" "If you don't let me work in peace I'll sew your head onto his."
// KINGS_WORKSHOP_DEAL_BOSS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3888975206" "I am doing GOD's work here. You'd do well to observe that."

// KINGS_SPY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3884448253" "Look at them, Ozwalt... Like sheep to be slaughtered."
// KINGS_SPY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145116607" "Calm down, Ozwalt... We must be patient."
// KINGS_SPY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1095671759" "Once THEY move out, WE move in..."
// KINGS_SPY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3951887555" "I think I found our number four, Ozwalt. Get ready."

// KINGS_SPY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3036300980" "Ozwalt! Break this hero's bones!"
// KINGS_SPY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3455797285" "Now's our chance, Ozwalt! Fetch me that hero!"

// KINGS_HARVEST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P699461659" "AHHH! My FACE! NO!"
// KINGS_HARVEST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3108912345" "HELP! Somebody get it off me!"
// KINGS_HARVEST_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2797354670" "Somebody PLEASE! Get it off me!"

// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3496429235" "Yes... ALL of the flesh."
// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1629984737" "Be calm, child. Screaming only serves to excite her more."

// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1334044313" "A HERO!? Can't you see we are WORKING here?"
// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3778468118" "My child! Show this foolish hero ALL of what you have learned!"
// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1654930912" "Here's another for you, my child. Come now! Practice makes perfect."
// KINGS_HARVEST_AMUSED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3679981049" "Ah! Another plaything for my creation!"

// KINGS_RISEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1255956509" "Ah, this is fine work. The good doctor would be pleased."
// KINGS_RISEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P489042" "This is damn fine work. The good doctor would be proud."
// KINGS_RISEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3290084843" "No... Something is not right with this one."
// KINGS_RISEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1831197031" "Nice work. This one is stinkier that usual."

// KINGS_RISEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P479890119" "What luck! A hero has come to test our creature's mettle!"
// KINGS_RISEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P434747017" "Come now, creature! Break this fool's spine!"
// KINGS_RISEN_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2198740155" "HOW does this keep happening??"

// KINGS_RISEN_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P263730788" "No! Back to the drawing board with this one."
// KINGS_RISEN_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2309596398" "This one will not do! Break it down and distribute its materials amongst the others."
// KINGS_RISEN_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2532695301" "What is THIS you bing me!? Take it away!"

// KINGS_HARVEST_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P306244080" "Yes, my MINION! Tenderize the meat!"
// KINGS_HARVEST_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3058875436" "That's it! Make sure the meat is nice and tender."
// KINGS_HARVEST_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3872816849" "So many of my own traits I see in him. Truly a PROUD moment!"
// KINGS_HARVEST_ANGRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3142875203" "Yes! ...he never tires."

// KINGS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P662521529" "Keep your eyes peeled."
// KINGS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1594703938" "Remember, we only need lots that are under five feet and female."
// KINGS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2863789717" "We only need one body for tonight's lot. If you spot ANYONE alone we ALL move in."
// KINGS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P410985606" "Beautiful night for a stroll... And a murder."

// KINGS_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3136008563" "Superhero flesh might do the trick for tonight's treat!"
// KINGS_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1159600708" "Here's one!"
// KINGS_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3457959655" "This one's as good as ours!"

